            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.2 — Address bar that drops down</h3>
<ul>
<li>Click anywhere on the top bar's address to edit it. The address bar drops straight down from the bar, in the bar's own color.</li>
<li>It lines up with where the address starts and is as wide as the bar's address area.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
