            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.1 — A new top bar</h3>
<ul>
<li>A Dia-style bar above the page: sidebar, back, forward and reload, and the site and page title. Click the title to edit the address.</li>
<li>With the sidebar hidden, the window buttons move into the bar.</li>
<li>Prefer the old look? Settings › Appearance › Top of the page › Minimal line.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
